WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.590
Are you really going to cut it?

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:08.900
What? You said you wanted it cut.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.190
You said drying it is a pain.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.890
I did, but...

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.050
You said it's hot and muggy out.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.080
And that this would make a 
good summer memory.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.980
I'm sure I didn't say that.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.910
He wasn't asking you to cut it.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.530
Relax your shoulders.

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:35.360
Don't be so uptight, Shun-chan.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:43.400
Actually, it makes me nervous that 
you guys are more relaxed than I am.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.680
Let's begin.

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:48.100
I look forward to working with you.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.910
Um, I appreciate the thought...

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:54.530
but don't cut it too short.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:01.910
Wait a minute. Are you 
both cutting my hair?

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.080
Don't worry. We have two scissors...

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:07.420
...but our heart is one.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:14.390
Are you sure you're not 
cutting too much, Yutan?

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:18.890
This side's shorter now.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:23.330
You're not one at all.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:24.850
You should do it my way.

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:27.340
Can't we do it my way for once?

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:30.440
Please don't cut and talk at the same time!

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.460
It's hot out.

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:38.370
Let's cut it real short.

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:40.950
I don't want it that short.

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:44.140
That's a nice, summery style.

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:45.950
Cut more off! Cut it off!

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:51.700
Um, summer's almost 
over. You can stop now.

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:53.160
Don't be shy.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.130
This'll look good.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.860
No, it won't.

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:59.060
Careful! Stop moving.

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.970
There's no way they're going to listen to you.

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:07.210
In the unyielding sweltering heat,

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:10.530
our short summer was coming to an end.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:12.840
Oh.

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.980
"Oh?" What do you mean by "oh"?!

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.980
Don't worry about it.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:18.780
Yuki, you...

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:20.560
What is it?

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:22.890
You shouldn't worry about it.

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:53.670
I told you to only cut a little bit off.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:57.830
If my hair's too short, it'll start curling.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:03:59.380
Sheesh.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:01.760
Come in.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:04.100
Thank you for having us.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.180
Hello.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:08.810
Wow, you really took 
a leap, didn't you?

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:11.930
You haven't looked like that since middle school.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.380
Shun-chan, you kept your hair 
short till middle school?

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:20.940
Yes, and my hair was curly back then.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:25.870
I bet you were one cute 
middle-schooler, Shun-chan.

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:31.160
Is your summer homework 
coming along well?

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:35.040
If we had Kaname-kun's notes...

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:40.990
Y-Yes, Kaname-kun's a fantastic teacher.

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:45.550
Oh my. I taught him 
subtraction when he was little,

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.180
and now he's become the teacher.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.180
Isn't that right, Kaname-sensei?

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.920
You're the only one who calls me that.

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:56.760
Don't you need to go 
shopping for dinner?

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:59.060
Would you like to go 
with me, Kaname-kun?

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:03.910
No. Can't you see I'm studying?

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.820
You used to come with me.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:11.190
What's more important, your 
mother or your studies?

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:14.250
Didn't you hear her?

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.890
What's more important, her or your work?

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:19.340
You can study till your eyes bleed,

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.500
but it'll make no difference if you don't 
understand girls, Kanamecchi.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.230
She's not a girl! She's my mother!

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.080
Fine.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:32.630
I can tell your studies are 
more important to you than your own mother.

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:37.080
You made her cry.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.750
You shouldn't make girls cry!

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:43.320
Shut up! Just get out of here, Mom!

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:44.440
You're in the way!

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.220
Sorry.

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:00.300
How sad.

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:00.820
What are you doing?

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:02.050
Chase after her 
and tell her you're sorry.

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:04.770
It could be the beginning 
of a relationship.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:07.560
She wants you to chase 
her. Can't you see that?

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:09.810
Enough already!

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:20.230
This watermelon's delicious.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:25.820
I could never put salt on 
something so delicious.

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:31.610
I prefer eating them as they are, too.

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:34.030
I wonder why people put 
salt on watermelon...

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:39.310
The salt makes the watermelon 
seem even sweeter, doesn't it?

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:43.790
And distance makes the heart 
grow fonder, doesn't it?

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:45.300
No, it doesn't.

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:51.990
I guess I could put salt on it if 
I got tired of the flavor.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:56.640
Yeah. Kaname, when you and your 
mother get tired of living together...

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:59.000
Add salt.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:02.810
No way! Finish your 
food and do your work!

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:05.570
Thanks for the food.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.630
All right!

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:11.670
I feel like I've gotten smarter.

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:15.460
I can do it. I know I can do it.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:19.330
Illness starts in the mind and 
studying starts with glasses.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.120
Kanamecchi, do you want some?

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:25.910
You already have some! How stupid I am!

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:30.270
If you have time to play 
with cheap glasses,

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:32.490
you might as well do some homework!

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:36.970
100 yen stores have everything.

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:39.760
Memorization set.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.570
Victory headband.

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:42.740
Stress ball.

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:45.770
Squeezing it stimulates your brain.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.430
They really do have everything.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:53.310
Why did you buy all this 
unnecessary stuff to study?

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:55.230
It just happened.

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:03.000
Kanamecchi, how long have 
you been wearing glasses?

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:07.500
Yeah, how long has it been?

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.680
Forget about that and study–

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:13.290
You didn't have them in kindergarten.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.420
You were already looking

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:18.140
at the world through rose-colored 
glasses, though.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:22.830
There was that one rainy day, when we 
were making teru-teru bozu dolls...

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:27.210
I bet you'll draw weird faces on yours.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.260
You're so mean.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:32.360
You're viewing us through 
rose-colored glasses.

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:35.210
That's called prejudice.

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:45.040
That wasn't prejudicial at all.

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:50.430
In any case, you've been wearing 
glasses since you were born.

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:51.800
Don't say that!

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:54.200
That's awful.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.510
You're childhood friends,

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:59.040
but you forgot when Kanamecchi's 
image change happened.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:03.640
We didn't forget. We never 
remembered it in the first place.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:07.880
That's nothing to be proud of.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:10.800
Didn't you start wearing glasses 
in the second year of middle school?

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.690
Second year?

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:15.070
No, that was...

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.200
Tsukahara-kun.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:20.650
Aren't these yours?

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:22.850
Oh, thank you.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:25.980
I can't believe you left them 
in the science room already.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:28.400
You should wear them all the time.

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:30.960
<i>Yeah, but...</i>

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:34.710
His glasses were like the bottoms of milk bottles.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:36.990
Let's call him nerd 
next time we see him.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.720
They don't look cool.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:47.230
One, two, three, four, five,

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:50.500
six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.250
I lost again.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:56.110
Yuki-kun, you're too 
good at thumb wrestling.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.450
You're just too weak, Shun.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.870
Shall I take you on left-handed?

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:05.910
If you use your left hand, Shun 
will have to use his left hand, too.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.390
Oh, you're right.

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:09.280
What are you doing?

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:10.540
Kaname-kun.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:13.920
Thumb wrestling in middle school?

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:15.770
You must have nothing to do.

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:19.630
If you have time for that, 
let's go check out some clubs.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:21.890
We've got to decide soon.

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.930
But thumb wrestling is fun.

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:29.940
Look at this. Yuki-kun 
drew a portrait of me.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.200
Isn't it cute?

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.250
This is mine.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:37.150
He's saying, "I can beat you
even while reading manga."

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:40.820
That's right. Yuki's really 
good at thumb wrestling.

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:43.610
That's great.

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:47.710
I don't think it'll play much of a role 
in our middle school lives, though.

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:51.520
Kaname, have your eyes gotten worse?

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:54.720
Huh? Um, a little.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:59.710
Really? Do you have trouble 
seeing the board?

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:02.940
I'll wear glasses during class.

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:04.210
Glasses?

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.790
Kaname-kun, you got glasses?

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.360
Show us how you look in them.

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:09.870
I wanna see that.

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:10.610
Are those your glasses? Is that the case?

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:13.230
Don't touch them.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.610
I'll never wear them 
in front of you guys.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:18.240
You'll laugh at me.

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.750
Shun's not like that.

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.550
I'm talking about you two.

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:25.990
I'm sure you'll call 
me "nerd" or "four-eyes."

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:28.650
We wouldn't say that.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:31.280
Or would we?

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:33.000
Why can't you give a clear answer?

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:37.250
Why don't you have a thumb wrestle me, Kaname?

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:41.010
If I win, you will show us what you 
look like with your glasses on.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.800
What? Why would I...

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:44.510
Sounds good.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:45.440
Hey!

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:47.800
I'm so excited.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:49.520
Why'd you answer for me?

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:53.450
It's decided. Kaname, I'll draw 
a face on your thumb, too.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:55.540
I don't need one!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:57.790
Stop it!

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:58.900
Hold still.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.850
If you move, your face will be weird.

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:03.110
It's weird enough already.

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:04.720
Matsuoka-kun.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:05.690
Yes?

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:07.630
What are you doing?

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.290
It looks fun.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.910
We're thumb wrestling.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:13.580
Thumb wrestling?

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:20.920
Drawing a portrait on your thumb
is part of thumb wrestling.

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:22.200
See?

00:12:23.190 --> 00:12:25.090
How cute. This, too?

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:26.470
That's right.

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:32.980
Yuta-kun, do you like drawing?

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:33.700
What?

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:34.980
Are you joining the Art Club?

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:38.990
We haven't decided what 
club we're joining yet.

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:40.850
The Art Club wouldn't be bad.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:46.020
The boys in the Volleyball Club 
saw Yuta-kun during PE...

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:49.510
and said they wanted 
tall guys like him.

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:52.030
That's Yuki.

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:52.580
What?

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:55.830
That's Yuki. I'm Yuta.

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:01.790
I-I'm so sorry.

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.460
How embarrassing.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:06.350
We made a mistake.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:10.000
People get the two of you mixed up a lot.

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:08.350
But they're both so good looking.

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:11.150
They really do look alike.

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:13.230
They're identical.

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:13.230
We're exactly the same, aside from our bangs.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.820
Should I make the eyebrows thicker?

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:17.420
Do you want round glasses?

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.640
Silver frames? Milk bottles?

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:19.190
Ow.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.450
What do you mean it's just your bangs?

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:25.900
You piss me off way more than he does!

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:41.100
East, Asaba Shoryu.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:47.390
West, Tsukahara.

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:48.930
I don't get a title?

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:52.780
Face each other... Ready...

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:55.480
Begin!

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.060
Amazing. What a match.

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:04.940
Kaname's pretty good.

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:09.120
You think you can beat me while reading manga?

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:11.160
I've got this one in the bag.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.590
Watch it!

00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:17.450
It wasn't on purpose.

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:19.600
My hand slipped.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.790
Hey, ref.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.460
He just violated the rules.

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:26.680
You'll have to put your 
glasses on to protect your eyes.

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:28.130
Yes.

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:31.240
Why? Just punish him.

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:32.340
Okay, okay.

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:36.460
Yuki, if you foul three times, you lose.

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:38.140
Three's plenty.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:39.940
He's only got two eyes.

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:43.440
Kaname-kun, calm down.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.440
Start over.

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:52.210
Play fair this time.

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:53.450
Fine, fine.

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:56.870
Ready, fight!

00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:59.660
Look at that!

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:02.340
I've never seen such thumb wrestling.

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:02.300
That wasn't a foul. That was a ten-don.

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.460
A what? That doesn't even make sense!

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.460
It's gone way beyond thumb wrestling now.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:09.380
This sucks.

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:13.510
What? Are you resigning because 
you're afraid you'll lose?

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:16.840
Just let us see what 
your glasses look like.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.930
You... Wait!

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:20.800
Stop!

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:23.310
I'll just take a peek.

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:24.410
Ow.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.470
That hurt.

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:29.220
Apologize, first year.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:30.940
The glasses.

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:31.280
Hey!

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:34.010
Sorry.

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:35.120
There, there.

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.330
I can't believe first years these days.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.000
Glasses, glasses.

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:45.180
What are you doing, Yuki? You have to apologize.

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:48.800
If you keep acting like that, 
they'll have it in for you.

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.130
Have it in for him?

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.510
You know...

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.770
Some older punks will get underclassmen...

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:01.810
to meet them behind the gym
 and then, they'll beat them up.

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:04.030
It happens all the time in manga.

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:07.820
Really? How scary.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:10.040
You'll be fine, Shun.

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:13.470
They might ask you to meet them 
there for other reasons, though.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:22.540
Don't do anything dangerous, Yuki-kun.

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.820
Me? I'll be fine.

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:28.220
Even if something happens,

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:30.070
maybe they'll let me 
settle it peacefully...

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:31.460
with a thumb wrestling match.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.690
As if you'd settle something peacefully.

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.100
It's oil-based ink.

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:47.110
Yuki's definitely going to 
run into trouble eventually.

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:49.390
Hey, Yuki...

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:58.120
Is he in there? I can't see.

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:01.090
Hey, Yuki...

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:02.430
Where's Yuki Asaba?

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:03.370
Asaba-kun?

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:09.350
I just saw Asaba-kun heading towards 
the gym with some third years.

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:10.380
Third years?

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.150
<i>Can't be...</i>

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:29.590
<i>But...</i>

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:32.530
<i>he's going to the gym 
with some upperclassmen.</i>

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:41.740
<i>This could be...</i>

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:45.960
<i>This could be bad!</i>

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:57.710
It's his fault he doesn't 
have any manners.

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:02.600
<i>It serves him right.</i>

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.520
Yuta! Shun!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:21.800
Kaname-kun, what's wrong?

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:26.170
Yuki was...

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:29.080
Yuki was dragged off behind the gym!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.330
What?

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:33.340
It's probably because he refused to

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.070
apologize when he bumped 
into them yesterday.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.050
Let's go to the gym and...

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.090
No, it's fine.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:43.340
What are you talking about? 
Aren't you worried?

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:44.960
If we don't do something,

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:47.980
Yuki's gonna get beat 
up by some third years!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.540
Can you call yourself Yuki's...

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:59.740
We don't know if he's been beaten up yet.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:03.050
Just stand up. Come on.

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:04.990
Huh? What are you all doing?

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.280
Yuki's gonna...

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:09.260
Huh?

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.540
Yu... ta?

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:13.460
Yeah.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:14.290
Huh?

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:17.260
Some guys from the Volleyball Club

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:21.640
forced me to go to the 
gym to watch them play.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:24.930
It was a hassle, but I went anyway.

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:23.900
Then...

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:27.470
The gym? Then...

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:28.260
One, two, three, four, five,

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:30.980
six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:35.080
I win, Kaname-kun.

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:39.150
So, what happened to Yuki?

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:42.610
Nothing, nothing, nothing at all!

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:44.600
Shun, you should have told me!

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:50.360
I was going to, but you 
seemed so desperate.

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:52.060
I wasn't...

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:53.740
Yuta, what am I going to do?

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:55.730
Kaname was so worried about–

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:57.300
Don't say it!

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:02.010
Kaname-kun, are those...

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:05.890
I know you lost at thumb wrestling,

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:09.220
but I didn't think you'd 
actually wear them.

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:13.110
Nothing good comes from 
not being able to see.

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:15.520
Not bad. They look good on you.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:19.190
Why does that sound 
condescending coming from you?

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:23.360
Hey! What are you drawing?

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:25.870
They really do look good on you.

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:29.520
You don't have to say that.

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:33.870
Kaname-kun, you look 
really good in glasses.

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:39.330
Finished.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.290
You used oil-based ink again!

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:42.290
Who cares?

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:44.880
You'll be wearing glasses from now on,

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.510
Kaname-lens kun.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.990
What's Kaname-lens?!

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:57.250
I remembered something 
I shouldn't have.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:21:00.570
I'll carry that shame to my grave.

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:03.700
So, how long have you had glasses for?

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:04.960
Since second year of middle school?

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:07.690
Yeah, my second year of middle school.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.700
Wasn't it our first year...

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.520
Kaname-lens kun?

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:17.580
What? What's a Kaname-lens?

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:16.610
You...

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:22.720
Well, Kaname was really 
worried about me...

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:25.070
Don't say it!

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:38.110
Masaki-chan.

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:43.860
Do I look weird?

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:46.610
...suits you.

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:47.560
Huh?

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:50.110
It really suits you!

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:52.810
Really? That's good.

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:03.560
Sorry.

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:07.660
It's from Chizuru-kun.

00:22:09.710 --> 00:22:13.040
I got my hair cut at Kaname-kun's.

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:14.620
Really?

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:21.470
I got my hair cut,

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:24.150
but it didn't help with the 
heat as much as I expected.

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:26.240
Shall we go?

00:22:27.220 --> 00:22:28.160
Yeah.

00:22:31.360 --> 00:22:36.010
Among the sunset clouds 
and occasional breeze,

00:22:36.010 --> 00:22:39.470
I could feel the summer ending.

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:44.960
Glasses and Et Cetera

00:24:16.560 --> 00:24:20.030
Next time: Next to an Apple
